          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Fifteen minutes and a quarter cup of water answers a question that gets argued about endlessly online, and it answers it for your slab rather than for granite in general. Add the oil test, because oil is what actually ruins countertops.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Then write the date down and do it again next year. Sealing is cheap and quick when a test catches the transition; it is a stain removal project when it does not.
          </p>
